werful combinations. It allows me to take control from the landlord without overcommitting resources, while keeping flexibility for future plays. Passing would give control to the teammate, but since we don’t know their hand, taking control with a cheap card like queen is safer and maintains pressure on the landlord.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣Q"]}'}
